{"sha":"c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f","node_id":"C_kwDOACN7MtoAKGMyMGJiYTIzNGYzZTFkY2Q4MWY3YTJlYzIxZWE3YmYwMWE0Y2YzNWY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Maurizio Lombardi","email":"mlombard@redhat.com","date":"2026-09-15T09:58:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"Keith Busch","email":"kbusch@kernel.org","date":"2026-09-25T15:06:20Z"},"message":"nvme: do not reset controllers in NVME_CTRL_NEW state\n\nDuring NVMe controller creation, the controller is exposed to sysfs via\nnvme_add_ctrl() while it is still in the NVME_CTRL_NEW state.\nThis creates a narrow race window where a userspace process can write to\nthe reset_controller sysfs node before the initialization thread\ntransitions the state to NVME_CTRL_CONNECTING.\n\nIf a reset is triggered during this window, the state machine allows the\ntransition from NVME_CTRL_NEW to NVME_CTRL_RESETTING, and the reset work\nis queued. However, the original creation thread continues its execution,\nsubsequently moving the state to NVME_CTRL_CONNECTING and finally to\nNVME_CTRL_LIVE.\n\nWhen the delayed reset work finally executes, it attempts to tear down\nthe controller and transition the state to NVME_CTRL_CONNECTING. Because\nthe state is now NVME_CTRL_LIVE, this transition fails, triggering a\nWARN_ON in the reset work.\n\nFix this by removing NVME_CTRL_NEW from the allowed prior states for\nthe NVME_CTRL_RESETTING transition.\n\nFixes: 8bfc3b4c6f9d (\"nvmet: switch loopback target state to connecting when resetting\")\nReported-by: syzbot+4a1d521d19d6321f5aad@syzkaller.appspotmail.com\nReviewed-by: Daniel Wagner <dwagner@suse.de>\nSigned-off-by: Maurizio Lombardi <mlombard@redhat.com>\nSigned-off-by: Keith Busch <kbusch@kernel.org>","tree":{"sha":"52dd770232cf42ec24c1822bb055ac63f1ccd53d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/trees/52dd770232cf42ec24c1822bb055ac63f1ccd53d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/commits/c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f/comments","author":{"login":"maurizio-lombardi","id":1124821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjQ4MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1124821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi","html_url":"https://github.com/maurizio-lombardi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maurizio-lombardi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"keithbusch","id":4249494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDk0OTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4249494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch","html_url":"https://github.com/keithbusch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keithbusch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"447a7a3026eda85ac2738cbe6ee5ab066a39dad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/447a7a3026eda85ac2738cbe6ee5ab066a39dad0","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/447a7a3026eda85ac2738cbe6ee5ab066a39dad0"}],"stats":{"total":1,"additions":0,"deletions":1},"files":[{"sha":"76f1fbe8d9b65c0cdf3c8ef17126414d15fc6e5e","filename":"drivers/nvme/host/core.c","status":"modified","additions":0,"deletions":1,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f/drivers%2Fnvme%2Fhost%2Fcore.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/raw/c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f/drivers%2Fnvme%2Fhost%2Fcore.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/contents/drivers%2Fnvme%2Fhost%2Fcore.c?ref=c20bba234f3e1dcd81f7a2ec21ea7bf01a4cf35f","patch":"@@ -598,7 +598,6 @@ bool nvme_change_ctrl_state(struct nvme_ctrl *ctrl,\n \t\tbreak;\n \tcase NVME_CTRL_RESETTING:\n \t\tswitch (old_state) {\n-\t\tcase NVME_CTRL_NEW:\n \t\tcase NVME_CTRL_LIVE:\n \t\t\tchanged = true;\n \t\t\tatomic_long_inc(&ctrl->nr_reset);"}]}